  id: spell-ray-of-frost
  displayName: Ray of Frost
  description: A frigid beam of blue-white light streaks toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, it takes 1d8 cold damage, and its speed is reduced by 10 feet until the start of your next turn (speed reduction not modeled -- no Speed stat exists yet). Damage increases by 1d8 at 5th, 11th, and 17th level (not modeled).
